The first implementation is now running its full gate suite, including 200,000 structure-aware guesses and eight exact reference solves. The generator samples the compact key before constructing the polygon, and `verify` never consults the planted answer; I’m using this run to catch both geometric containment bugs and any “cheap attack” that accidentally exploits the planting.
diff --git a/gen_2404_09835.py b/gen_2404_09835.py
